{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>And I will bring faintness.</b> Terror and faintness of heart; the mem of מֹרֶךְ is a falling radical, like the mem of מוֹעֵד and of מוֹקֵשׁ." "<b>And they shall flee as one flees from the sword.</b> As if pursuers were killing them." "<b>A driven leaf.</b> — the wind pushes it and strikes it against another leaf and rattles it and produces a sound. And thus its Targum: קַל טַרְפָּא דְשָׁקִיף — a term of striking; ״שְׁדוּפוֹת קָדִים״ (Genesis 41) — שְׁקִיפָן קִדּוּם, a term of מַשְׁקוֹף, the place where the door strikes; and thus the Targum of ״חַבּוּרָה״ (Exodus 21) — מַשְׁקוֹפֵי."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:49.202610351Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}